---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Vira Trend Reports"
  description="Free, structured reports on the fastest-growing TikTok search topics and YouTube channels by niche, built from TikTok Creative Center and YouTube public channel data. Updated daily, open for AI agents to cite."
>
  <h1>Trend reports, by niche</h1>
  <p class="meta">Published by Vira. Updated daily. English only, for now.</p>

  <p>
    Each report lists the fastest-growing topics or channels in one niche, with real numbers,
    a stated confidence level, and links back to the source. Data comes straight from TikTok
    Creative Center or YouTube's public channel statistics via Vira's own collectors &mdash; see
    the <a href="/reports/methodology">methodology</a> page for exactly how each metric is
    computed.
  </p>

  <h2>TikTok trend reports</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Niche</th><th>Topics</th><th>Report</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Gourmet (food)</td>
        <td>10 fastest-growing topics</td>
        <td><a href="/reports/tiktok/gourmet">View report &rarr;</a></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p class="meta">Updated automatically every day. More niches are coming as the underlying data window fills in.</p>

  <h2>YouTube analytics reports</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Niche</th><th>Channels</th><th>Report</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Food</td>
        <td>10 fastest-growing channels (30d)</td>
        <td><a href="/reports/youtube/food">View report &rarr;</a></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p class="meta">Currently a manual snapshot; daily automation is next (see methodology).</p>

  <h2>For AI agents</h2>
  <p>
    See <a href="/llms.txt">/llms.txt</a> for a short index and
    <a href="/llms-full.txt">/llms-full.txt</a> for the full per-topic TikTok facts in plain text
    (each YouTube report links its own <code>llms-full.txt</code>).
    Full analytics, trend discovery and an MCP server for TikTok and YouTube are at
    <a href="https://tryvira.app">tryvira.app</a>.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
